swimlane-beta TB
  accTitle: 退货、验收与退款的跨部门流程
  accDescr: 客户发起退货后，客服确认资格，仓库验收商品，财务退款；不符合条件的申请进入说明和申诉路径。
  subgraph Customer [客户]
    request[申请退货]
    send[寄回商品]
    receive[收到退款]
  end
  subgraph Support [客服]
    eligibility{符合规则}
    label[提供退货单]
    explain[说明原因]
  end
  subgraph Warehouse [仓库]
    inspect{验收通过}
    restock[商品入库]
    exception[记录异常]
  end
  subgraph Finance [财务]
    calculate[计算退款]
    refund[原路退款]
  end
  request --> eligibility
  eligibility -->|是| label
  eligibility -->|否| explain
  label --> send --> inspect
  inspect -->|是| restock --> calculate --> refund --> receive
  inspect -->|否| exception --> explain
